DESCRIPTION:Europa League league phase draw\nFriday 28 August 2026\n\nFro
 m UEFA headquarters in Nyon. Time to be confirmed.\n\n36 clubs drawn int
 o four pots of nine. Each club is drawn against two teams from every pot
 \, one home and one away.\n\nAfter this\, the full fixture list is relea
 sed and this calendar can be rebuilt with actual matches.
