SUMMARY:🥉 Europa League - Matchday 1
DESCRIPTION:Europa League - Matchday 1 (day 1 of 2)\nWednesday 16 Septemb
 er 2026\n\nNotes\nLeague phase opens. Europa League nights are Thursdays
  from Matchday 2 on.\n\n56th season\, second under the 36-team league ph
 ase. Each club plays eight different opponents\, four home and four away
 .\\n\\nTop eight go straight to the last 16\; 9th to 24th enter a two-le
 gged play-off. Aston Villa are holders after beating Freiburg 3-0 in Ist
 anbul.\\n\\nThe winners qualify for the 2027/28 Champions League league 
 phase.\\n\\nFIXTURES ARE NOT YET KNOWN - the draw is on 28 August 2026. 
 Matches are Thursday evenings\, normally 17:45 and 20:00 UK time.
CATEGORIES:Europa League,Matchday 1
URL:https://www.uefa.com/uefaeuropaleague/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
