DESCRIPTION:UEFA Europa League Final\nWednesday 26 May 2027\n\nDeutsche B
 ank Park (Waldstadion)\, Frankfurt.\n\nKick-off to be confirmed\; recent
  finals have been 20:00 UK time.\n\nAston Villa are defending champions 
 after beating Freiburg 3-0 in Istanbul. The winners go into the 2027/28 
 Champions League.
